OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day today with a mix of
OL,6,Fsunshine and fair weather cloud. The
OL,7,Fsunshine also becoming rather hazy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling hot with light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry and fine evening to
OL,11,Fcome with plenty of late sunshine.
OL,12,FLittle changes overnight with clear
OL,13,Fskies and light winds. A rather warm
OL,14,Fnight to come.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA bright start but skies
OL,17,Fbecoming rather cloudy by lunchtime.
OL,18,FRemaining dry throughout though with
OL,19,Fsunshine returning later. Feeling a
OL,20,Flittle cooler but still warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
