OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FLargely dry next week with plenty of
OL,7,Fsunshine and light winds. Turning
OL,8,Fhotter and more humid from mid-week
OL,9,Fwith some very warm nights.
